  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="28">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:VAtr">V Atr</ref> 28</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">And gif hwa buton leafe of firde gewænde þe se cyningc silf on sy, plihte him silfum oððe wergilde.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And if anyone deserts an army which is under the personal command of the king, it shall be at the risk of [losing] his life or his wergeld.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">And gyf hwa butan leafe of fyrde gewende, þe se cyning sylf on sy, plihte him sylfum ⁊ ealra his are.</ab>
      </div>
